  <s:String x:Key="S.Share.TreeHint">Checked: kept here, as a placeholder or with content.&#10;Not checked: still transferred, then deleted here once the placeholder threshold is reached.</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="S.Share.ScanInterval">Full rescan interval (s)</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="S2.ScanInvalid">The rescan interval needs a number of 30 seconds or more.</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="S.Share.Watch">Watch the folder for changes</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="S.Share.WatchHint">The file system reports changes as they happen. Not every drive can do this — network drives and some drivers report nothing, or only part of it. Unticked, the folder is scanned in full every minute instead: slower and more expensive, but complete.</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="S.Share.InExplorer">Show in the Explorer navigation pane</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="S.Share.InExplorerHint">Unticked, the entry next to “This PC” disappears. The folder stays where it is and is still synchronised; placeholders, cloud icons and the context menu work unchanged.</s:String>
